  2025.

  • Robinson changed outfits after the shooting, from shorts and a maroon
  T-shirt to jeans and a

  black sweatshirt.

  • The rifle was found wrapped in a towel in nearby woods, and Robinson
  allegedly attempted to

  recover it but encountered police.

  • Robinson confessed via text messages to his roommate and on Discord, stating
  he killed Kirk

  because he "spreads too much hate." abc7.com +9

  • Robinson's DNA matched evidence found on the towel around the rifle and a
  screwdriver on

  the roof.

  cnn.com +2

  • Bullet casings were engraved with taunting, anti-fascist messages.

  • Robinson surrendered on September 11, 2025, after a family member contacted
  authorities.

  cbsnews.com +9

  • Prosecutors charged Robinson with aggravated murder on September 16, 2025,
  and are

  seeking the death penalty.

  foxnews.com +4

  • Robinson had become more political in recent years and discussed his dislike
  for Kirk with

  family.

  • The rifle belonged to Robinson's grandfather and was given to him as a gift.
  cnn.com +1

