  & Expert v

  • Candace Owens has claimed Robinson was not on the UVU campus on the day of
  the

  shooting, contradicting official accounts.

  • Conspiracy theories suggest involvement of others, including FBI suppression
  of evidence or

  ties to CIA, but official investigations indicate Robinson acted alone.

  • No autopsy details or bullet from Kirk's body have been released, fueling
  speculation.

  • Robinson's parents are in hiding due to death threats following the
  incident. @TheDibsterx

  • Robinson is due back in court on October 30, 2025. foxnews.com

